cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "TierDecay"
abstract: >-
  A self-distilling model router for AI coding CLIs that solves each
  problem-class once at an expensive model tier, compiles the solution into
  a playbook entry, and routes subsequent occurrences of that class to
  progressively cheaper tiers based on an empirical ledger of predicted
  versus executed outcomes.
